# setuptools-scm puts every git-tracked file in the sdist.  These are the
# working directories of the repo, not of the package: internal planning docs,
# scratch scripts and notebooks have no business on PyPI.  Tests, examples and
# the small fixture data under data/ stay, so an sdist is still runnable.
prune docs
prune scripts
prune notebooks
prune tools

# Root-level working notes.  prune only takes directories.
exclude AGENTS.md ui_refactor.md
exclude "AMDock Backend Refactoring.md"
